cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, with the date or commit of the version you used."
type: software
title: "STARpaleomag_Py: paleomagnetic data processing software"
abstract: "Python software for paleomagnetic data processing: demagnetization diagrams, direction fitting (PCA, great circles, automatic interpretation), site means, paleointensity (Thellier-type, Arai diagrams), anisotropy of remanence, and MagIC import/export. Python version of the Starmac programs of the paleomagnetism laboratory of Rennes."
